{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2022-05-03 16:39:00', 'title': 'JPMORGAN CHASE FILES FORM 10-Q FOR THE QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2022', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--JPMORGAN CHASE & CO. (NYSE: JPM) (“JPMORGAN CHASE” OR THE “FIRM”) HAS FILED ITS QUARTERLY REPORT ON FORM 10-Q FOR THE QUARTER ENDED MARCH 31, 2022 WITH THE SEC. THE REPORT IS AVAILABLE ON THE SEC'S WEBSITE AT WWW.SEC.GOV AND WILL BE AVAILABLE ON THE FIRM'S INVESTOR RELATIONS WEBSITE AT WWW.JPMORGANCHASE.COM/IR UNDER SEC FILINGS & OTHER DISCLOSURES. JPMORGAN CHASE & CO. (NYSE: JPM) IS A LEADING FINANCIAL SERVICES FIRM BASED IN THE UNITED STATES OF AMERICA ("}{'symbol': 'JPM', 'date': '2022-05-03 08:30:00', 'title': 'J.P. MORGAN LAUNCHES TAX SMART SMA PLATFORM TO HELP ADVISORS CREATE CUSTOMIZED PORTFOLIOS ON DEMAND', 'text': "DIGITAL PLATFORM LEVERAGES 55IP'S ACTIVETAX® TECHNOLOGY TO ALLOW ADVISORS TO CREATE CUSTOMIZED, TAX-EFFICIENT PORTFOLIOS CUSTOM INVEST - U.S. LARGE CAP EQUITY IS THE FIRST STRATEGY ON PLATFORM, BENCHMARKED TO S&P 500 NEW YORK , MAY 3, 2022\xa0 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- J.P. MORGAN ASSET MANAGEMENT\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF A NEW TAX-SMART SEPARATELY MANAGED ACCOUNT (SMA) PLATFORM ALLOWING ADVISORS TO BUILD CUSTOMIZED PORTFOLIOS AND SEEK BETTER AFTER TAX RETURNS FOR THEIR CLIENTS."}